WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.880
I'm excited to show you the original version of days in the sun

00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:05.960
It starts with the prince's mother played by Harriet Jones

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:09.400
Singing her favorite lullaby to her son who lies in the sick bed

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:12.940
Later, it's the mother who's in bed. She's just died

00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:15.460
And the young prince is pulled away by his father

00:00:15.460 --> 00:00:18.940
We re-shot this, you know, because of a mistake I made

00:00:18.940 --> 00:00:22.460
When we previewed the movie, there were people in the audience who got confused

00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:24.600
They thought Harriet was actually Hattie Morahan

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:26.720
Who plays Agathe the enchantress

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:31.040
The actresses actually look very much alike so sadly when we did it again

00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:35.340
Even though it is once again Harriet, we had to put her in bed, and with dark hair

00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:39.500
Sadly, it meant we had to recast the boy because in the new version it was now a singing part

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:41.780
And we needed someone with a trained voice

00:00:41.780 --> 00:00:45.180
I'm thrilled to able to finally share what I thought was a wonderful

00:00:45.180 --> 00:00:48.880
Really lovely performance from Harriet Jones in this clip

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:51.940
music

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:00.880
Rest now, my love

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:09.060
Days in the sun, where your life has barely begun

00:01:10.080 --> 00:01:18.420
Not until my own life is done, could I ever leave you

